{
  "summary": "The PR implements a bulk selection API for filter lists. It correctly introduces `SetFilterLists` across the JNI bridge, core logic, and persistence layers. The implementation ensures atomicity (invalid inputs reject the whole batch), deduplication, and preservation of other configuration states (like custom filters). The test suite covers persistence, observer notifications, and idempotency. No major architectural or security issues identified.",
  "approved": true,
