    "Consider adding a test case for a batch containing a mix of valid and invalid URLs to explicitly verify the 'all-or-nothing' rejection logic."
  ],
  "recommended_changes": [
    "Ensure `base::android::AppendJavaStringArrayToStringVector` handles null elements within the array if that is a possibility in the UI layer."
  ]
